## 2026-08-25  order-consolidation-recalib
#116 DA-gated-encoding FACULTY flipped default-ON (records memories more strongly when engaged;
verified LOAD-BEARING — high-DA vs low-DA writes a stronger trace, lesion collapses it; no-regression
+ OFF byte-identical; consolidation trigger on the idle tick; next-rung #138). #75 vision readout
PARTIAL (signed linear-discriminant spiking readout: spike-port quantization SOLVED, wall relocated
