de-risk, next-rung #137). #130 RESOLVED to a decisive verdict (order-sensitive consolidation
recalibration). Was CALIBRATION_NEEDS_REVISION; diagnosed as replay winner-take-all (episode-agnostic
random replay let the stronger memory hog consolidation) + numpy->cupy operating-point drift, NOT a
broken order-STDP. Revised to balanced directed-sweep replay + isolated order-STDP: 6-seed GO on the
decisive seeds (42/43/44/100/101/102) with all anti-cheats intact (STDP-off collapses the margin to
0.0000, lesions->0, false recall ~0), and 4/5 on the disjoint v6-NO-GO seeds (a real fix, not a
re-tune). Residual banked: the behavioural win is recall-SPEED (attenuates at long probe); the
physical trace strengthening is probe-independent. cupy confirm queued on gpu_queue. Gate result (not
yet production-integrated). NOTE: this entry was stamped by the order-consolidation subagent before
the live board task #130 itself was updated — see the 2026-08-25 docs+board sync entry below for that.

